    "text": "<p>Mass of 1 mole of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>125</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>125</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>Similarly, mass of <math><mn>1</mn></math> mole of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>300</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>Let molar mass of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math> is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/cfdd4456-43ae-46f1-9e59-78b793afa2f4-74222e9a-945e-4986-9e98-32199df035c6-image34.png\" style=\"width: 321px; height: 219px;\" /></p>",
